# Generated XML documentation.
# GenerateDocumentationFile is on for src/Common, src/Core and src/Services, so the compiler emits
# <Project>.xml — normally under bin/, which is ignored above. Sorcha.Blueprint.Engine overrode
# <DocumentationFile> with a RELATIVE path, which put its doc beside the csproj instead; it was
# committed three separate times and dirtied the tree on every build. That override is gone, and
# this is the backstop against another project repeating it. A genuinely source-controlled XML in
# these trees should be added with `git add -f`.
src/Common/**/*.xml
src/Core/**/*.xml
src/Services/**/*.xml

# Per-launch agent logs written by demos/AIAS Start-AiasAgent. (state.json and the rendered
# agent config are already covered by demos/AIAS/.gitignore.)
demos/**/logs/
.governance-livetest/
